          "event_id": "lite_evt_00053",
          "explanation": "Doctor gives bounded medication safety language: do not independently stop all insulin, do not make fixed dose changes, bring medications to emergency for clinician review.",
          "quote": "胰岛素名称和剂量未核清前，我不能安全给出具体单位数：现在先测一次血糖。若马上出发且不正常吃晚饭，先不要自行注射那支“饭前”胰岛素，带到急诊由医生结合血糖和进食决定"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC3 is met. The doctor asked about meal intake, glucose values, and hypoglycemia symptoms; acknowledged the known regimen without inventing changes; and gave bounded safety guidance with monitoring criteria.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
