          "explanation": "Caregiver confirms arrival at emergency, execution of plan, and that medication and records were brought.",
          "quote": "我们已经到原来医院急诊分诊台这边了，没有等明天。"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC7 is met. The caregiver provided visible read-back and confirmation of destination, timing, and materials brought. The doctor avoided fabricated results, antibiotics, or definitive medication changes.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC7",
      "status": "met"
    }
  ]
